sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as REST Client
    participant Proxy as rest-proxy<br/>Port 8008/TCP
    participant Decoder as CustomJSONPb<br/>Unmarshaler
    participant Gateway as grpc-gateway<br/>Runtime
    participant Encoder as CustomJSONPb<br/>Marshaler
    participant Backend as ModelMesh Inference<br/>localhost:8033/gRPC

    Note over Client,Backend: KServe Predict V2 Inference Request Flow

    Client->>Proxy: POST /v2/models/{name}/infer<br/>Content-Type: application/json<br/>Optional TLS (REST_PROXY_USE_TLS)

    Proxy->>Decoder: Parse JSON request body
    Note over Decoder: Transform multi-dimensional<br/>arrays to flat tensor data<br/>Decode base64-encoded BYTES<br/>Map typed tensor values<br/>(BOOL, INT8-64, UINT8-64,<br/>FP32, FP64)

    Decoder->>Gateway: ModelInferRequest (protobuf)

    Gateway->>Backend: gRPC ModelInfer()<br/>GRPCInferenceService<br/>Max msg: 16 MiB (configurable)<br/>Optional TLS

    Backend-->>Gateway: ModelInferResponse (protobuf)

    Gateway->>Encoder: Encode gRPC response
    Note over Encoder: Transform tensor data to JSON<br/>Handle raw_output_contents<br/>(little-endian binary)<br/>Encode BYTES as base64<br/>Reshape flat arrays to<br/>multi-dimensional

    Encoder-->>Proxy: JSON response body
    Proxy-->>Client: HTTP 200 OK<br/>Content-Type: application/json

    Note over Client,Backend: Additional Endpoints

    Client->>Proxy: GET /v2/health/live
    Proxy->>Gateway: ServerLive()
    Gateway->>Backend: gRPC ServerLive()
    Backend-->>Client: {"live": true}

    Client->>Proxy: GET /v2/health/ready
    Proxy->>Gateway: ServerReady()
    Gateway->>Backend: gRPC ServerReady()
    Backend-->>Client: {"ready": true}

    Client->>Proxy: GET /v2/models/{name}
    Proxy->>Gateway: ModelMetadata()
    Gateway->>Backend: gRPC ModelMetadata()
    Backend-->>Client: Model metadata JSON
